   "description": "8/16-bit console-style chip sounds: pulse and triangle waves, stepped volume, crushed noise. One consistent set, silence-trimmed and loudness-matched (OGG, -1 dBFS peak). Cues: battleStart, attack, attack-blunt, attack-pierce, attack-claw, damage, actorDamage, critical, miss, defend, faint, bossCollapse, escape, defeat, cast. Code-synthesized OPRN procedural SFX (no samples). Free to use in games; no resale of the raw files."
  },
